;gt upp i ugnen ca 20 min, tills de f\u0026aring;tt fin f\u0026auml;rg.\u0026nbsp;"},{"order":3,"step":"Hetta upp olivolja i en stekgryta. Fr\u0026auml;s pressad vitl\u0026ouml;k och tomatpur\u0026eacute; ca 1 min, under omr\u0026ouml;rning. Blanda ner krossade tomater, mediterranean spice, socker och gr\u0026ouml;nsaksbuljong. Koka upp och sjud till servering.\u0026nbsp;"},{"order":4,"step":"\u003cstrong\u003ePasta: \u003c/strong\u003eKoka linguine enligt anvisning p\u0026aring; f\u0026ouml;rpackningen. Spara lite pastavatten n\u0026auml;r du h\u0026auml;ller av pastan."},{"order":5,"step":"\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFetaosttopping:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eFinstrimla bladpersilja och smula fetaost. L\u0026auml;gg i en sk\u0026aring;l."},{"order":6,"step":"\u003cstrong\u003eAubergine- och tomats\u0026aring;s:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eBlanda ner auberginen i s\u0026aring;sen. Sp\u0026auml;d med sparat pastavatten till \u0026ouml;nskad konsistens.\u0026nbsp;Smaka av med balsamvin\u0026auml;ger, lite salt och nymald svartpeppar.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;"},{"order":7,"step":"Blanda ner avrunnen pasta i tomats\u0026aring;sen och servera med fetaosttopping och ruccola."}]}],"ingredientSections":[{"sectionId":"869248","sectionTitle":"Aubergine- och tomatsås","ingredients":[{"ingredientId":18461,"order":"0","name":"aubergine","amount":"1","ingredientAmountType":"st","isBasis":false,"hasAllergyFriendlyAlternative":false,"images":{"priority":1,"isFeatured":true,"urls":[{"size":"small","url":"https://pimimages.azureedge.net/images/ingredients/resized/bfa5818a-3811-4925-babc-e681824a51a4.jpg"},{"size":"large","url":"https://pimimages.azureedge.net/images/ingredients/largeResized/bfa5818a-3811-4925-babc-e681824a51a4.jpg"}]},"imagesExtra":null,"allergies":[]},{"ingredientId":4062,"order":"1","name":"bakplåtspapper","amount":"1","ingredientAmountType":"st","isBasis":true,"hasAllergyFriendlyAlternative":false,"images":null,"imagesExtra":null,"aller